| `roberta-large` | Hugging Face `roberta-large` | `722cf37b1afa9454edce342e7895e588b6ff1d59` | MIT | masked-LM candidate word per gap |
| `gpt2-large` | Hugging Face `gpt2-large` | `32b71b12589c2f8d625668d2335a01cac3249519` | MIT | base full-sentence reranker (all gaps) |
