| `Qwen2.5-1.5B` | Hugging Face `Qwen/Qwen2.5-1.5B` | `8faed761d45a263340a0528343f099c05c9a4323` | Apache-2.0 | cascade reranker |
| `SmolLM2-1.7B` | Hugging Face `HuggingFaceTB/SmolLM2-1.7B` | `effd688a12921b4cc83e3312b6feb579f70f9c71` | Apache-2.0 | cascade reranker |

No external data was used for training; all statistical artifacts (retrieval index) are
built only from `data/train_v2.txt`. No test labels were accessed.

## Code
- `combine/assemble` stage: `workspaces/castor_iota/assemble_submission.py` (+ `retrieve_full.py`).
- MLM candidate generation: `workspaces/castor_iota/mlm_test.py`.
- Base rerank: `workspaces/castor_iota/rerank_test.py`.
- Cascade rerank: `workspaces/achernar_tau/cascade_multi.py`.
- Cost-aware decoder / alternative decision layer / validation: `workspaces/alkaid_pi/decode.py`,
  `featlib.py`, `score.py`.

## Reproduction sketch
```
python castor_iota/mlm_test.py          # roberta-large, top-8 words per gap
python castor_iota/rerank_test.py --model gpt2-large   # all-gaps base scores
python achernar_tau/cascade_multi.py --models "gpt2-xl,Qwen/Qwen2.5-1.5B,HuggingFaceTB/SmolLM2-1.7B" --topk_gaps 4
python castor_iota/assemble_submission.py --margin 0.06 --retrieval castor_iota/retrieval_recovered.tsv
```
